From e40d2403f8aac5858f58030d2c013381c186c4c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:47:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] arm64: dts: apple: add S8003 and J71t device trees
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

S8003 SoC and iPad 5 (J71t) board device trees for the drivers in this
series. Nodes for blocks without a driver here (GPU, SEP, AOP) stay
described but are not used.

From the release 2 kernel of the iPad 5 port
(https://github.com/brkosebay/omarchy-ipad5), filtered for OrchardLinux.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
